      "content": "Hey, I'm working on an op-ed about the history of public health mandates. Can you give me a summary of the main arguments used by scientists versus the arguments used by civil liberties advocates regarding mandatory vaccination protocols? I need to make sure I'm covering both sides properly for my piece.",
