    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. To balance it out, can you do the same for the scientific side? I need to understand the core logic they use to justify why the collective benefit outweighs those individual rights—like, what are the specific scientific or ethical frameworks they rely on to support the mandate approach?",
